  "notes": "Label is used to provide a name or title for an input field. Label can be placed before or after the field.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/label/+page.md",
  "code": "<label class=\"floating-label\">\n  <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Input\" class=\"input input-xs sm:input-sm md:input-md lg:input-lg xl:input-xl\" value=\"Placeholder\" />\n  <span>Input</span>\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"floating-label\">\n  <textarea placeholder=\"Textarea\" class=\"textarea textarea-xs sm:textarea-sm md:textarea-md lg:textarea-lg xl:textarea-xl\">Placeholder</textarea>\n  <span>Textarea</span>\n</label>\n\n<label class=\"floating-label\">\n  <select class=\"select select-xs sm:select-sm md:select-md lg:select-lg xl:select-xl\">\n    <option disabled selected>Placeholder</option>\n    <option>Option</option>\n  </select>\n  <span>Select</span>\n</label>",
